# Environment variables for Babel Fish (Vite)
#
# No runtime env vars are required for v1. The static build ships with
# built-in defaults: rate limit of 60 requests/minute, HTTPS enforcement off
# (GitHub Pages already serves HTTPS), and Gemini suggestions deferred.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_, via import.meta.env, and
# inlines them into the public JS bundle at build time. Never put a secret
# here. Optional overrides, read by src/App.jsx:
#
# VITE_MAX_REQUESTS_PER_MINUTE=60
# VITE_ENABLE_HTTPS_ENFORCEMENT=true
